Thesis advisor: Arno Sch&ouml;negge.<br>
In German, 08/1998.<br>

<span class="tooltip">Abstract <span class = "tooltiptext">
<p> An extended version of the above paper, in German. The core idea
	  is the same, but it is complemented by several related
	  results, and gives more detail and definitions. </p>
</span></span>
and <a href="publications/diplarb.ps">thesis (Postscript)</a>.</li>

<li>Martin Giese, David Kempe, Arno Sch&ouml;negge:
KIV zur Verifikation von ASM-Spezifikationen
am Beispiel der DLX-Pipelining Architektur.<br>
